our vector search - Which chunk has the most similar meaning?
BM25 asks something different - Which chunk contains the important words from my query?


BM25 score
   │
   ├── TF
   │     └── does the term occur, and how often?
   │           ↳ diminishing returns
   │
   ├── IDF
   │     └── how rare is the term across chunks?
   │
   └── document-length normalization
         └── don't unfairly favor long chunks

